      "uid": "zhcn:9758e97829c3e7cc66eda62c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她此刻所看着的，\n是比这里更遥远的“彼方”景色。\n那是她的梦想之路的方向。",
      "source_fingerprint": "220a475c962af2a7d58d9b498805bd83ac505b240c043f35a8243a2e695bdc4e",
